Action: /m. then n repeatedly — must skip empty lines correctly

Regression test for GTK forward_to_line_end bug on empty lines.
Bug: line_text() returned next-line content for empty lines,
causing search_forward to find matches beyond the empty line's
actual length. set_cursor clamped the out-of-bounds column to 0,
creating an infinite loop where n kept "finding" the same match.

